flowchart LR
    A["SPEC<br/>规格定义"] --> B["CREATE<br/>文档创建"]
    B --> C["COLLABORATE<br/>团队协作"]
    C --> D["REVIEW<br/>多维度评审"]
    D -->|Reject 驳回| C
    D -->|Pass 通过| E["APPROVE<br/>定稿核准"]
    E --> F["FREEZE<br/>基线冻结"]
    F --> G["PUBLISH<br/>正式发布"]
    G --> H["KNOWLEDGE<br/>知识沉淀"]
    H --> I["ITERATE<br/>合规迭代"]
    I --> C
    H --> J["ARCHIVE<br/>资产归档"]
    J --> K["HISTORICAL<br/>历史只读闭环"]
    D -. Review Evidence .-> L["EVIDENCE BASE<br/>全量证据链仓库"]
    E -. Approval Evidence .-> L
    F -. Baseline Evidence .-> L
    G -. Publication Evidence .-> L
    J -. Archive Evidence .-> L
    I -. Iteration Evidence .-> L
